{"default":{"entry":{"id":"community-013","title":"校园跳绳比赛","kind":"notice","category":"sports","category_label":"运动健身","summary":"校级跳绳比赛于2026年5月12日下午在体育馆举行，通知请参赛学院安排赛前训练。","tags":["运动健身","官方公告"],"editorial_note":"","featured":true,"spotlight":false,"material_ids":[],"versions":[{"notice_id":"notice-b27eee9462bb41139da849d5","year":2026,"published":"2026-04-29","deadline":null,"deadline_kind":"notice","stage_start":"2026-05-12","stage_end":"2026-05-12","colleges":["sports"],"levels":["campus"],"college_role":"原文相关单位，不代表报名限制","level_basis":"依据公告标题中的范围词；选拔阶段单独保留。","audience":"参赛学院组织学生参赛；个人资格与项目安排见附件。","audience_scope":{"kind":"unknown","colleges":[],"evidence":"参赛学院组织学生参赛；个人资格与项目安排见附件。"},"source_url":"https://news.cdu.edu.cn/info/1112/48899.htm","conflict":false,"edition_label":"","original_title":"","registration_windows":[],"fact_count":null,"content_profile":{"sections":[],"coverage":{"audience":false,"conditions":false,"location":false,"registration":false,"materials":false,"schedule":false,"content":false,"benefits":false,"duties":false,"other":true},"truncated":true},"participation_facts":[]}],"collegeSelections":[]},"notice":{"notice_id":"notice-b27eee9462bb41139da849d5","year":2026,"published":"2026-04-29","deadline":null,"deadline_kind":"notice","stage_start":"2026-05-12","stage_end":"2026-05-12","colleges":["sports"],"levels":["campus"],"college_role":"原文相关单位，不代表报名限制","level_basis":"依据公告标题中的范围词；选拔阶段单独保留。","audience":"参赛学院组织学生参赛；个人资格与项目安排见附件。","audience_scope":{"kind":"unknown","colleges":[],"evidence":"参赛学院组织学生参赛；个人资格与项目安排见附件。"},"source_url":"https://news.cdu.edu.cn/info/1112/48899.htm","conflict":false,"edition_label":"","original_title":"","registration_windows":[],"fact_count":0,"content_profile":{"schema_version":"activity-profile-1","processed_on":"2026-10-17","status":"partial","sections":[{"kind":"other","title":"参与信息","items":[{"text":"各学院：","locator":"正文第1段","source_url":"https://news.cdu.edu.cn/info/1112/48899.htm"},{"text":"为响应“体育强则中国强，国运兴则体育兴”的口号，进一步推动校园体育活动开展，丰富我校学生课余生活，培养学生对跳绳运动的兴趣和爱好，展示我校学生良好精神面貌，发扬奋力拼搏、团结友爱、顽强进取的体育精神。经成都大学体育运动委员会研究，决定于2026年5月12日（周二）下午在体育馆举办成都大学第五届校园跳绳比赛。为确保本次比赛安全、顺利、圆满举行，望参赛学院积极组织好赛前训练工作。","locator":"正文第3段","source_url":"https://news.cdu.edu.cn/info/1112/48899.htm"},{"text":"附件：","locator":"正文第5段","source_url":"https://news.cdu.edu.cn/info/1112/48899.htm"},{"text":"1.第五届跳绳比赛《竞赛规程》.pdf","locator":"正文第6段","source_url":"https://news.cdu.edu.cn/info/1112/48899.htm"},{"text":"2.成都大学第五届校园跳绳比赛报名表.docx","locator":"正文第7段","source_url":"https://news.cdu.edu.cn/info/1112/48899.htm"},{"text":"3.第五届跳绳比赛《参赛承诺书》.docx","locator":"正文第8段","source_url":"https://news.cdu.edu.cn/info/1112/48899.htm"},{"text":"成都大学体育运动委员会","locator":"正文第9段","source_url":"https://news.cdu.edu.cn/info/1112/48899.htm"}]}],"attachments":[{"title":"1.第五届跳绳比赛《竞赛规程》.pdf","url":"https://news.cdu.edu.cn/__local/0/50/D3/D894D6A2F75EEB3F4FAF834A241_3FCCB501_120228.pdf","status":"未逐项读取"},{"title":"2.成都大学第五届校园跳绳比赛报名表.docx","url":"https://news.cdu.edu.cn/__local/F/63/12/8382D3D634E751C12A44D4FBD04_CB8F1AE0_4635.docx","status":"未逐项读取"},{"title":"3.第五届跳绳比赛《参赛承诺书》.docx","url":"https://news.cdu.edu.cn/__local/B/30/83/AB0B8967BACC3A134735EBE2E0B_A1A745B9_443A.docx","status":"未逐项读取"}],"pending":["参与对象本批未提取到","条件限制本批未提取到","地点本批未提取到","报名步骤本批未提取到","材料本批未提取到","日程本批未提取到","活动内容本批未提取到","费用与奖励本批未提取到","岗位职责本批未提取到"],"coverage":{"audience":false,"conditions":false,"location":false,"registration":false,"materials":false,"schedule":false,"content":false,"benefits":false,"duties":false,"other":true}},"participation_facts":[]},"groups":[],"activity_id":"community-013"},"notices":{"notice-b27eee9462bb41139da849d5":{"entry":{"id":"community-013","title":"校园跳绳比赛","kind":"notice","category":"sports","category_label":"运动健身","summary":"校级跳绳比赛于2026年5月12日下午在体育馆举行，通知请参赛学院安排赛前训练。","tags":["运动健身","官方公告"],"editorial_note":"","featured":true,"spotlight":false,"material_ids":[],"versions":[{"notice_id":"notice-b27eee9462bb41139da849d5","year":2026,"published":"2026-04-29","